1. **Mandatory Worktrees (Never edit directly on `main` / `master`):**
   - The primary checkout is **integration-only** and must stay on `main`.
   - **ALL task/ticket work MUST use a dedicated worktree** under `.worktrees/<task-slug>`:
     ```bash
     git worktree add -b <branch-name> .worktrees/<task-slug> origin/main
     ```
